  "bodyHash": "1dbd6a9bc11e5dcb",
  "content": "\n\n<p>此模組新增了兩種蘋果與一根胡蘿蔔，其提供的增益效果強於金蘋果或金胡蘿蔔。鑽石蘋果與獄髓蘋果可透過合成獲得，而附魔版本僅能在箱子或結構中找到。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_dd9cb5c5-1f3d-4846-9c43-110f9161d2a8.png\" alt=\"imagefabricapi\" width=\"218\" height=\"73\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349534/description_45428533-1bd4-454d-9b96-98b8222f7556.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"218\" height=\"73\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"https://discord.gg/u5fu3fKgCu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349534/description_3cb558c4-5c68-4576-b03a-5619d7050abf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"218\" height=\"73\"></a></p>\n<p>More Than Apples 需要&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Loader</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a> 以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraBlender</a></p>\n<p>更新內容？<br>🍎 新增食物</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349534/description_f1d4cc31-4c3d-402c-aebc-8c55cd71ec19.png\" width=\"285\" height=\"158\"></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349534/description_767e6bf4-3c83-4499-9620-39e6e9ce7ed7.png\" width=\"285\" height=\"150\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>青蘋果</strong> &ndash; 食用後賦予<strong>幸運</strong>效果<br><strong>Test_Apple</strong> &ndash; 可透過<strong>釣魚</strong>獲得。食用後賦予<strong>蘋果召喚</strong>效果。</p>\n<p><strong>鑽石蘋果</strong> &ndash; 提供比金蘋果更強的增益效果。可透過合成獲得或於戰利品箱子與結構中尋找<br><strong>附魔鑽石蘋果</strong> &ndash; 較為罕見的版本，僅能從戰利品箱子或結構中獲得<br><strong>鑽石胡蘿蔔</strong> &ndash; 金胡蘿蔔的升級版，提供優異的增益效果 (:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349534/description_a3381761-babc-4134-bfcc-d17af47026d9.png\" width=\"283\" height=\"146\"></p>\n<p><strong>獄髓蘋果</strong> &ndash; 威力更強，提供延長抗性、生命恢復及抵銷部分負面效果的保護。仍可透過合成獲得或於戰利品箱子與結構中尋找<br><strong>附魔獄髓蘋果</strong> &ndash; 極為罕見且無法合成的版本，擁有模組內最強大的效果，並對部分負面效果提供額外保護，僅能於戰利品箱子與結構中找到</p>\n<p>✨ 新增效果<br>黑暗免疫、緩慢免疫、挖掘疲勞免疫、寒冷抗性<br>蘋果召喚（特殊效果，讓你能在任何地方釣出蘋果）</p>\n<p>🌳 新增生態域<br>蘋果林園、金蘋果園、霜凍蘋果</p>\n<p>🌲 新增樹木類型<br>蘋果樹、金蘋果樹、測試樹、霜凍樹&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349534/description_9ee380ed-f8a0-439b-b8e3-7077d9b2abbf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"366\" height=\"207\"></p>\n<p>蘋果桶 - &nbsp;使用任意4塊木板與任意2顆蘋果合成</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
